Package: material-boot-core
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.9), python3-pil, librsvg2-bin
Description: The code and the command that Material GRUB and Material Plymouth share
 The shared code of the Material boot parts (palettes, the scene renderer, the
 conf and overrides formats, presets, the state record and the migrations), the
 shared data built from the distro catalog, and the material-boot command that
 the parts plug into. The data is built on this machine when the package is
 installed or updated, for the configured scheme. It installs no theme by
 itself: Material GRUB and Material Plymouth are separate packages that need it.
